## Why This Is Asked
Partition to maximize sum of per-segment MSS, capturing internal substructure within blocks.

## Key Concepts
- Maximum subarray sum per interval
- DP over partition indices
- Precompute MSS in O(n^2)
- Path reconstruction via parent pointers

## Code Example
